CodaLinux live image

  Graphical session: Hyprland autologin as user `live` on tty1
                     (VirtualBox VMSVGA uses a software-render wrapper)
  If the GUI fails:  /var/log/coda-hyprland.log
  Rescue console:    tty2 autologin (root)
  Network:           systemd-networkd + iwd    (iwctl)
  Locale defaults:   America/Denver, en_US.UTF-8, us  (Bozeman, Montana)
  Install:           coda-install
                     disk layout is interactive; region/timezone/locale/keymap are not asked

Locked stack: systemd-boot, ext4, official Arch repos only, no NetworkManager.
Support: https://github.com/codemodify/codalinux/issues
